{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00814","headline":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 灵长舞 · 张昭","name":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 灵长舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天降祥，汉祚昌。\n火炎上，水灵长。\n建庙社，洁蒸尝。\n罗钟石，俨珩璜。\n陈玉豆，酌金觞。\n气昭感，德馨香。\n祗洛汭，瞻晋阳。\n降吾祖，福穰穰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}